<v Keith>Yeah.
<v Keith>还好。

00:36:36.110 --> 00:36:44.790
<v Tobin Low>Keith huffs a couple of times, eventually wiping away some tears. He seems overwhelmed, like he wasn't expecting this depth of feeling from Evan.
<v Tobin Low>基斯重重地叹了几口气，最后擦掉了眼泪。他看起来有些不知所措，似乎没有料到埃文会有这么深的情感。

00:36:44.790 --> 00:37:18.180
<v Keith>I feel sad. I feel sad about how I handled it, how I communicated, and that I was hurtful to you. And I also am just sad for me and who I was then. So it just is placing me in that small room I paid $300 for or something with no furniture and wanting my life to be something that it wasn't.
<v Keith>我感到难过。我为我当时的处理方式、我的沟通方式感到难过，也为我曾伤害过你感到难过。同时我也为自己和那时的自己感到难过。所以这让我回到了那个我花300美元租的、空无一物的狭小房间里，渴望我的生活能变成它本不该成为的样子。

00:37:18.180 --> 00:37:39.700
<v Keith>And also, it makes me sad that you-- I think what you said, like, I have needed you as a friend and a person in my life, just makes me feel like just what a waste of time.
<v Keith>而且，这也让我感到难过，你——我想你刚才说的，比如，我需要你作为朋友和生命中的一个人，这让我觉得这一切简直是在浪费时间。

00:37:39.700 --> 00:37:42.520
<v Tobin Low>Evan is also taking it in, seems flustered.
<v Tobin Low>埃文也在细细体味，显得有些慌乱。

00:37:42.520 --> 00:37:56.300
<v Evan Roberts>It's so weird. It's so weird to be right here right now, Keith. I never thought I'd ever hear any of these things come out of your mouth.
<v Evan Roberts>这太奇怪了。此时此刻坐在这里感觉太奇怪了，基斯。我从没想过有一天会听到你嘴里说出这些话。

00:37:56.300 --> 00:38:04.820
<v Tobin Low>Keith asks if they can take a break. When we get back on the Zoom, I remind Evan we have one last piece of business-- the accidental text.
<v Tobin Low>基斯问他们能不能休息一会儿。当我们回到Zoom时，我提醒埃文还有最后一件事要处理——那条误发的短信。

